#. module: child_compassion
#: model:compassion.field.office,tpl_prayer:child_compassion.field_office_co
msgid ""
"The most vulnerable communities in our country are often those most affected"
" by violence. Please pray that the local church can continue to reach "
"children and families in remote and underserved areas of Colombia despite "
"increasing violence. Pray also that more young people will finish school and"
" go on to higher education so they are not drawn into recruitment by armed "
"groups."
msgstr ""
"In Colombia, le comunità più vulnerabili sono spesso quelle più colpite "
"dalla violenza. Preghiamo affinché la chiesa locale continui a raggiungere "
"le famiglie delle regioni isolate, nonostante l’insicurezza, e affinché i "
"giovani possano proseguire gli studi per sfuggire al reclutamento da parte "
"dei gruppi armati."

