#. module: child_compassion
#: model:field.office.learning,description:child_compassion.learning_tz1
msgid ""
"When they arrive, children are given tea served with an egg, bread or buns."
msgstr ""
"Al loro arrivo, i bambini ricevono un tè servito con un uovo, pane o panini "
"assortiti."

#. module: child_compassion
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:child_compassion.selection__compassion_child_ble__education_plan__will_be_working
